WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.282
Let's make five. Here is a row of five boxes. Three boxes have a counter.

00:06.732 --> 00:11.399
How many empty boxes? Two. Three and two make five.

00:11.849 --> 00:17.840
Now let's make ten. A ten frame has ten boxes. Seven boxes have a counter.

00:18.290 --> 00:23.096
How many are empty? Three. Seven and three make ten.

00:23.546 --> 00:27.099
Fill the frame to make ten. You can do it.

00:27.549 --> 00:34.585
Now you try. Pick a number up to five. How many more make five? Count the empty boxes.
